# tau-bench paper RESULTS (private — for me only; the harness code IS public).
# Keep run outputs local; other benchmarks/*.md artifacts stay tracked/public.
# Patterns are broad on purpose: any TAUBENCH*.md table and any taubench_raw*
# results dir (incl. confirmation/sweep variants) stays local.
benchmarks/TAUBENCH*.md
benchmarks/taubench_raw*/
# every tau-bench run/trace/pilot output dir is a private result; .md tables above stay tracked.
benchmarks/taubench_*/
benchmarks/*.log

# anonymized conference submission (private — pushing the anonymized .tex/PDF or
# the supplementary zip to the public repo would DE-ANONYMIZE the double-blind
# submission). The public preprint source (paper/tooltrim.tex) stays tracked.
paper/tooltrim_neurips.*
paper/tooltrim_supplementary_anon.zip
paper/abstract_plaintext.txt
paper/neurips_2026.sty

# LaTeX build artifacts (regenerated by the compiler; not source)
paper/*.aux
paper/*.log
paper/*.blg
paper/*.bbl
paper/*.out
paper/*.pdf
paper/*.synctex.gz
